type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"不，可是那样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。在这里，光防御并没有用。我们必须得主动寻找出路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，从高处！我们从楼梯走，反过来利用建筑里的走廊攻击它们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......不成，好像还是只能防御。但至少不会再被这一大群疯子挤在角落了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"对，先转移，然后通过各出入口聚拢，快速收缩队伍，进入防御姿态！快，动起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。加分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"长官，请跟我们一起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"你们去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_040","isRemote":false,"text":"我从地上走过去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcity_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"攻势太猛烈了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们装备的都是穿刺性武器，没法有效对抗他们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不能退后！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们背后是安全区！要是让他们打进去了，里面的市民就完了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那怎么办？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要战便战！战到近卫局一个都不剩为止！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心源石投掷物，除了会腐蚀装备以外，有些是会爆炸的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！阿中受伤了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿中，退下来！你，顶上去！别让它们穿过防线！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊！它，它抓到我了，它在咬，不，唉啊啊！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿义！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真丢人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纵贯白雷正法，去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，唔！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雷电法术？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什，什么......一瞬间就把这些躁狂患者都消灭了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才就说了不会出手不会出手，没想到，你们这些个样子怎么保护百姓？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到最后居然还是让我动手了，太丢脸了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队长","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"监察司长官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监察司","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长官前长官后的，不是让你们当我不存在吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队长","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们没想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监察司","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来想说精神可嘉，结果你们现在都活蹦乱跳的，还把事情丢给我解决，也不知道你们还能干些什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监察司","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走！去下个地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队长","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"可是你刚才说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监察司","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快指路！我都动手了，你们怎么就不知道动作快点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监察司","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，刚刚我没出手过，一定给我记住了，明白吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队长","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监察司","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但百姓要是受到一分一毫的伤害，你们都该撤职，我也得辞职，全部失业！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队长","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"明，明白......我们会尽力的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监察司","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道就好！还站在那干嘛？走呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监察司","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对了，你们认识那些黑蓑吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队长","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"黑蓑？那是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"监察司","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼力太差了吧！就是那些在楼顶上行动的，穿黑色蓑衣的人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局队长","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉长官，你说什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcity_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"盾卫出列！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"侦察队，后撤！死守火力点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这些突变感染者，居然还会扰乱电波？这样下去，侦察队也会有危险！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......没法停下来！止不住！你刚才一个人砍了多少这种东西？能不能再表演一遍？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？个仆街龙关键时刻怎么这么没用！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那你先表演点作用给我看看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"无人机！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"陈警司说了！！！侦察队！！！后撤！！！死守火力点！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我问你怎么样！火力小组，弩弹发射！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你把我弄耳鸣了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"去，用你这本领通知带β号源石电台的通讯小组，让他通知其他各大队，牧群棘手，坚守位置，尽量减少伤亡，别省火力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你可真是个*不雅用语*！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到你的嘴型了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"（“丢”音的嘴型）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陈sir！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我听不清！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陈sir！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"牧群","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（此起彼伏的咆哮）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"声音再大点！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陈sir！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局盾卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"用破墙弹！快！破墙弹！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"真安静啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"陈sir。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我听得见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"说。没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有......客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"已经来了吗？看来已经顺势混进我们的小队里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"也算是意料之中。他们不可能真放手让近卫局去做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"无所谓，不用改变任何计划。让他们看看龙门的实力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一个消息，我......不知道它的准确性怎么样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"有队员目击到身穿黑色雨披的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"恰好相反，我们发现的都是整合运动与他们